---
import PublicLayout from "../components/PublicLayout.astro";
const description = "Free hosted access and the MIT open-source stack. Team collaboration is planned. Contact Belweave about enterprise deployment and security requirements.";
const questions = [
  ["Is it really free?", "Yes. The existing first-party stack is MIT-licensed, with no paid feature gates. Hosted use is free with no plan-level device or agent cap, subject to fair-use rate, storage and concurrency limits."],
  ["What will Team cost?", "Pricing is not final. Team will be priced per active member, with unlimited devices within fair use. Email info@belweave.com to hear when it launches."],
  ["Can I self-host and use the cloud together?", "Yes. The hosted service and self-hosted stack use the same public codebase. Connect your agents to the deployments you choose; each deployment keeps its own devices and permissions."],
  ["What history is included?", "The baseline retains up to 5,000 action records and the latest 1,000 audit events per workspace, within a 16 MiB logical storage budget. Older settled receipts may be pruned as new work arrives. Pending and uncertain actions are preserved, and retired request keys cannot execute again. Export history you want to keep."],
  ["How do permissions work?", "Pairing a device does not authorize an agent. You grant specific functions per device and can revoke access and inspect retained receipts. Revocation can prevent queued work; it cannot guarantee that an action already started will stop. Use independent physical safety controls."],
  ["What is available for Enterprise?", "Contact Belweave to discuss deployment, onboarding, custom adapters and security requirements. SSO/SAML, SCIM, SIEM export and organization policies are planned. No certification, SLA or compliance commitment is included by default."],
];
---
<PublicLayout title="Pricing · openlaunch" description={description} active="Pricing">
<div class="pricing">
  <header class="pricing-intro"><p class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE · MIT LICENSED</p><h1>Free to start.<br />Built to scale with your team.</h1><p class="lede">openlaunch is open source. Use it free, self-host it anywhere,<br class="desktop-break" /> and pay only when your team needs more control.</p></header>
  <section class="plans" aria-label="Pricing plans">
    <article class="plan free"><p class="eyebrow">AVAILABLE NOW</p><h2>Free</h2><p class="audience">For individuals and early projects</p><p class="price">$0 <span>/ month</span></p><a class="button primary" href="/console/">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="caption">No subscription required.</p><p class="feature-label">Included in the core</p><ul><li>Unlimited devices and agent connections*</li><li>Full MIT open-source stack, self-hostable</li><li>Per-function grants and revocation</li><li>Action receipts and baseline history</li><li>Community support</li></ul></article>
    <article class="plan"><p class="eyebrow">PLANNED</p><h2>Team</h2><p class="audience">For teams sharing devices and agents</p><p class="price upcoming">On the way…</p><button class="button" disabled>Coming soon</button><p class="caption"><a href="mailto:info@belweave.com?subject=openlaunch%20Team%20waitlist">Get notified <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p><p class="feature-label">What we’re building toward</p><ul><li>Shared workspaces and roles</li><li>Device groups and larger broadcasts</li><li>Longer history and export options</li><li>Approval notifications</li></ul><p class="plan-note">Seat-based pricing. No price or launch date set.</p></article>
    <article class="plan"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK</p><h2>Enterprise</h2><p class="audience">For organizations with custom requirements</p><p class="price">Custom</p><a class="button" href="mailto:info@belweave.com?subject=openlaunch%20Enterprise%20inquiry">Contact us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="caption">Tell us what your organization needs.</p><p class="feature-label">Discuss with Belweave</p><ul><li>Self-hosted or dedicated deployment needs</li><li>Onboarding and custom adapters</li><li>Security review and support requirements</li></ul><p class="plan-note">Planned: SSO/SAML, SCIM, audit retention controls, SIEM export and organization policies. Scope and commitments agreed individually.</p></article>
  </section>
  <p class="fair-use">* No plan-level device or agent cap. Hosted rate, storage and concurrency limits apply to keep the service reliable. <a href="/docs/api#download-activity">Read the hosted limits →</a></p>
  <section class="principles"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE PUBLIC CODEBASE</p><h2>Yours to run.<br />Yours to build on.</h2></div><div><p>The console, protocol, SDKs, CLI and adapters live together in the same public repository that powers hosted openlaunch. The existing first-party stack is MIT-licensed.</p><p>Grants, revocation and action receipts are part of the free core. Future collaboration and governance features are planned; they aren’t requirements for getting started.</p><a href="https://github.com/pkyanam/openlaunch">Explore the source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="questions"><h2>Questions</h2><div>{questions.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
  <aside class="verification"><p>Connecting software is only part of the story. Hardware acceptance is documented separately.</p><a href="/docs/status">See verification status →</a></aside>

</div>
</PublicLayout>
<style>
.pricing{--ink:#141414;--muted:#606060;--line:#dedede;--surface:#fff;max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:64px 40px 32px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface);font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui),sans-serif}.pricing *{box-sizing:border-box}.pricing a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}.pricing a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.pricing a:focus-visible,.pricing summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.4px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2.6px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 24px}.lede{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0;max-width:680px}.plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:52px;border:1px solid var(--line)}.plan{padding:28px 26px 30px;min-width:0}.plan+.plan{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.free{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 3%,var(--surface))}.plan .eyebrow{margin-bottom:22px}h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.7px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 10px}.audience{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);min-height:42px;margin:0}.price{font-size:39px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-1.4px;line-height:1.2;min-height:48px;margin:25px 0 24px}.price span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)}.upcoming{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-1px;display:flex;align-items:center}.button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--surface);font:inherit;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none!important;color:var(--ink)}.pricing a.button.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--surface)}.button:hover{opacity:.8}.button:disabled{border-color:var(--line);color:var(--muted);cursor:not-allowed;opacity:1}.caption{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);min-height:36px;margin:12px 0 20px}.feature-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px}.plan ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:13px}.plan li{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;padding-left:19px;position:relative}.plan li:before{content:'✓';position:absolute;left:0}.plan-note{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:22px 0 0}.fair-use{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:18px 0 0;max-width:850px}.fair-use a{white-space:nowrap}.principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.55fr;gap:60px;padding:48px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:22px}.principles h2{font-size:29px;line-height:1.2}.principles p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted)}.principles a{font-size:12px}.questions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.55fr;gap:60px;padding:44px 0}.questions details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.questions summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;padding:18px 0}.questions summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.questions details:first-child summary{padding-top:0}.questions details[open] summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}.questions details p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 26px 20px 0;color:var(--muted)}.verification{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.verification p{margin:0;max-width:600px}.verification a{white-space:nowrap}:global(.dark) .pricing,:global([data-theme='dark']) .pricing{--ink:#eee;--muted:#aaa;--line:#3c3c3c;--surface:#111}@media(max-width:850px){.pricing{padding:40px 24px 28px}.plan{padding:24px 18px}.price{font-size:33px}.upcoming{font-size:25px}.principles,.questions{gap:28px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.7fr}}@media(max-width:650px){h1{letter-spacing:-1.5px}.desktop-break{display:none}.plans{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:32px}.plan{padding:26px}.plan+.plan{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.audience{min-height:0}.caption{min-height:0}.principles,.questions{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.verification{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.fair-use a{white-space:normal}}
</style>
